# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for `wrangler dev`. Leave AUTH_PROVIDER empty (in wrangler.jsonc) for an agent-only deployment.
# With AUTH_PROVIDER=clerk CLERK_ISSUER, CLERK_AUTHORIZED_PARTIES, CLERK_JWT_KEY and CLERK_SECRET_KEY are required; CLERK_API_URL and
# AUTH_ROLE_CLAIM (default vibase_role) are optional. CLERK_JWT_KEY is a PEM: real line breaks or literal \n escapes, optionally quoted.
# There is no CLERK_WEBHOOK_SECRET on D1 (CORE64): membership lives in Clerk, as the vibase_role claim.
CLERK_ISSUER=
CLERK_AUTHORIZED_PARTIES=
CLERK_JWT_KEY=
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=
AUTH_ROLE_CLAIM=
CLERK_API_URL=
